### Battery Units API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5194/api

### Variables
@stationId = {{$guid}}
@batteryModelId = {{$guid}}
@batteryUnitId = {{$guid}}

### 1. Get all battery units
GET {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get battery units by station
GET {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/station/{{stationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Create single battery unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "BAT001-TEST",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}"
}

### 4. Add multiple batteries to station
POST {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/add-to-station
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryUnits": [
    {
      "serial": "BAT002-BULK",
      "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}"
    },
    {
      "serial": "BAT003-BULK",
      "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}"
    },
    {
      "serial": "BAT004-BULK",
      "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Get specific battery unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Update battery status to Charging
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

1

### 7. Update battery status to Full
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

0

### 8. Update battery status to Maintenance
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

2

### 9. Update battery status to Issued
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

3

### 10. Delete battery unit
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/BatteryUnits/{{batteryUnitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Helper: Get existing stations for testing
GET {{baseUrl}}/Stations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Helper: Get existing battery models for testing
GET {{baseUrl}}/BatteryModels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}